<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 1.295 bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 1.295 bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan (SBP) has accepted 1.295 billion rupees in its special open market operation on Monday in short term federal bonds, a SBP statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		    Offered    Accepted    Max cut-off Outright</p>
<p>sale   6.000 bln  1.295 bln   17.20 pct/yr 1-month repo</p>
<p>0.020	  nil			    3-month repo    0.510</p>
<p>   nil 5-month repo    0.500	  nil Total	     7.030</p>
<p>1.295</p>
<p>($1=40.49 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
